## solutions

#### iterative

```cpp
int longestStreak(Node* head) {
  Node* current = head;
  Node* prev = nullptr;
  int currentStreak = 0;
  int longestStreak = 0;

  while (current != nullptr) {
    if (prev == nullptr || current->val == prev->val) {
      currentStreak += 1;
    } else {
      currentStreak = 1;
    }

    if (currentStreak > longestStreak) {
      longestStreak = currentStreak;
    }

    prev = current;
    current = current->next;
  }

  return longestStreak;
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(1)
